Description: Voice-to-text transcription app
 VoiceInk provides fast, accurate voice-to-text transcription
 using local AI (whisper.cpp) or cloud services.
 .
 Features:
  - Local transcription with whisper.cpp
  - Cloud transcription (OpenAI, Deepgram, Groq)
  - AI text enhancement
  - System tray integration
  - Global hotkeys
  - Transcription history
  - Per-app Power Mode profiles
